    <string name="privacy_title">How Privacy Works</string>
    <string name="privacy_main_heading">Privacy First</string>
    <string name="privacy_1_title">1. Zero Internet</string>
    <string name="privacy_1_desc">This app has no capability to connect to the internet. We do not use analytics, tracking, or cloud sync. All data stays strictly on your device.</string>
    <string name="privacy_2_title">2. Location Hashing</string>
    <string name="privacy_2_desc">Your raw location and time data is never sent to anyone. It is converted into an irreversible \"hash\" (a scramble of text). When comparing with a friend, the app only checks if any of these scrambles match.</string>
    <string name="privacy_3_title">3. Explicit Consent</string>
    <string name="privacy_3_desc">We never share any hashes in the background. You and your friend must both explicitly tap \"Compare\" on the discovery screen to initiate the exchange.</string>
    <string name="privacy_4_title">4. Full Control</string>
    <string name="privacy_4_desc">You can delete all scanned data instantly from the Settings menu. Because everything is local, deleting it here means it\'s gone forever.</string>

